WEBVTT

00:05:56.516 --> 00:06:00.876
the minimum amount of ocean
we would protect would be 30 percent.

00:06:02.116 --> 00:06:05.116
So 30 percent of the ocean is the floor,

00:06:05.156 --> 00:06:10.116
the minimum area that we need to protect
if we want to preserve marine life

00:06:10.156 --> 00:06:12.596
and all the benefits
it provides for people.

00:06:13.396 --> 00:06:15.676
Similar analysis has been
done for the land,

00:06:15.716 --> 00:06:18.676
also showing 30 percent as a minimum.

00:06:19.636 --> 00:06:20.836
Armed with this research,

00:06:20.876 --> 00:06:25.036
we at National Geographic partnered
with the Wyss Campaign for Nature,

00:06:25.076 --> 00:06:28.316
and launched a campaign for "30 by 30,"

00:06:28.356 --> 00:06:31.716
meaning at least 30 percent of the planet,